`root: core` points the globs at the plugin's own tree, so the run needs no project at all —
outside any vault it still exits 0 and returns paths relative to the plugin root.
`the-same-spec-without-root-still-needs-a-vault` runs the identical spec with `root` dropped.

-- fixtures/xdg/booping/config.yaml --
core:
  probe_playbook:
    queries:
      shipped_playbooks:
        glob:
          - playbooks/*/playbook.md
        where:
          name: groom
        root: core
-- cmd --
booping query --config core.probe_playbook.queries.shipped_playbooks --output paths
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
playbooks/groom/playbook.md
-- stderr --
